Mr. S, an advocate, is in the business of providing professional services like filing of petitions before Tribunals and Courts. Mrs. B, wife of Mr. S, is a registered Insolvency Professional (IP) with the IBBI. Mr. S, in his capacity of an advocate, filed many applications relating to admission of corporate debtors before NCLT and his wife Mrs. B being an insolvency professional in her own professional capacity acts as Insolvency Professional in all the cases her husband takes up. …";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}s:11:"last_change";a:10:{s:4:"date";i:1760513770;s:2:"ip";s:9:"127.0.0.1";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:27:"case_studies:lie_exam:case1";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:23:"created - external edit";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:3627;s:9:"timestamp";i:1760513770;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}s:6:"plugin";a:1:{s:13:"plugin_acmenu";a:1:{s:6:"sub_ns";a:3:{i:0;s:21:"case_studies:lie_exam";i:1;s:12:"case_studies";i:2;s:0:"";}}}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1760534181;}s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:7:"creator";s:0:"";s:11:"last_change";a:10:{s:4:"date";i:1760513770;s:2:"ip";s:9:"127.0.0.1";s:4:"type";s:1:"C";s:2:"id";s:27:"case_studies:lie_exam:case1";s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:3:"sum";s:23:"created - external edit";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:3627;s:9:"timestamp";i:1760513770;s:4:"mode";s:4:"page";}}}